ing inequalities are strict).\n\n- The second set is *neither open nor closed*. It contains some of its boundary points, for example, the point $(0,3).$ On the other hand, it does not contain some other boundary points, for example, the point $(3,2).$\n\n- The third set is *neither open nor closed*. It contains some of its boundary points, for example, the point $(-1,3).$ On the other hand, it does not contain some other boundary points, for example, the point $(0,2).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-105437/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5c6044dc-d4a7-5662-a825-3c13e49d198a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105437"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71820/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "ae4585da-32e2-5518-bdcf-a999396955e5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71820/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "90fc032f-75d8-5939-8ced-84e69ab270ba" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71820/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "385e4778-985d-5e03-9be2-f6e0f9dc9cf4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71820/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "ccdf5cc6-1487-5ca7-b474-001715203b52" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71820/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "635e058d-dad8-552d-8a4a-c548bafbe782" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answe